#
msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "Add Rule"
msgstr "Dodaj pravilo"

msgid ""
"Add rules to define which profile and entity the user will receive based on "
"their email domain (Optional)."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte pravila za definiranje kojeg profila i entiteta će korisnik primiti "
"na temelju svoje domene e-pošte (Neobavezno)."

msgid "Automatically create users on first login"
msgstr "Automatski kreiraj korisnike pri prvoj prijavi"

msgid "Configuration updated."
msgstr "Konfiguracija je ažurirana."

msgid "Default Rule (Fallback)"
msgstr "Zadano pravilo (zamjena)"

msgid "Default entity (ELSE)"
msgstr "Zadani entitet (INAČE)"

msgid "Default profile (ELSE)"
msgstr "Zadani profil (INAČE)"

msgid "Domain (after @)"
msgstr "Domena (nakon @)"

msgid "Entity"
msgstr "Entitet"

msgid "Failed to create the user in GLPI."
msgstr "Stvaranje korisnika u GLPI-ju nije uspjelo."

msgid "Google SSO"
msgstr "Google SSO"

msgid "Google SSO — Configuration"
msgstr "Google SSO — Konfiguracija"

msgid "Google authentication failed: %s"
msgstr "Google autentifikacija nije uspjela: %s"

msgid "Google login cancelled: %s"
msgstr "Google prijava otkazana: %s"

msgid "Google response without authorization code."
msgstr "Googleov odgovor bez autorizacijskog koda."

msgid ""
"If the user email does not match any of the rules above, this profile and "
"entity will be used. Mandatory if automatic creation is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Ako korisnikova e-pošta ne odgovara nijednom od gore navedenih pravila, "
"koristit će se ovaj profil i entitet. Obavezno ako je automatsko kreiranje "
"omogućeno."

msgid "Invalid OAuth2 state. Try again from the login page."
msgstr "Nevažeće stanje OAuth2. Pokušajte ponovno na stranici za prijavu."

msgid "Leave blank to keep current secret (stored encrypted)."
msgstr ""
"Ostavite prazno da biste zadržali trenutnu tajnu (pohranjeno šifrirano)."

msgid "No GLPI user corresponds to this Google account."
msgstr "Nijedan korisnik GLPI-ja ne odgovara ovom Google računu."

msgid "Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "Prihvaćaju se samo računi s domene %s."

msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

msgid "Profile and Entity Rules by Domain"
msgstr "Pravila o Profilima i Entitetima po Domeni"

msgid "Register this Redirect URI in Google Cloud Console:"
msgstr "Registrirajte ovaj URI za preusmjeravanje u Google Cloud Console:"

msgid "Restrict to domain (optional)"
msgstr "Ograniči na domenu (neobavezno)"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Spremi"

msgid "Select..."
msgstr "Odaberite..."

msgid "Session not initialized: user has no enabled profile."
msgstr "Sesija nije inicijalizirana: korisnik nema omogućen profil."

msgid "Sign in with Google"
msgstr "Prijavite se s Googleom"

msgid "The Google account does not have a verified email."
msgstr "Google račun nema potvrđenu e-poštu."

msgid "This user is deactivated in GLPI."
msgstr "Ovaj korisnik je deaktiviran u GLPI-ju."

msgid "or"
msgstr "ili"

msgid ""
"Leave the option <strong>\"Remove domain of logins in form "
"login@domain\"</strong> as <strong>No</strong>. If enabled, users with the "
"same prefix in different providers (e.g., admin@gmail.com and "
"admin@institution.edu.br) will suffer account overlap."
msgstr ""
"Ostavite opciju <strong>\"Ukloni domenu prijava u obliku "
"prijava@domena\"</strong> kao <strong>Ne</strong>. Ako je omogućeno, "
"korisnici s istim prefiksom u različitim pružateljima usluga (npr. "
"admin@gmail.com i admin@institution.edu.br) trpjet će preklapanje računa."

msgid ""
"Check the <strong>Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button</strong> option "
"below and click <strong>Save</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Označite opciju <strong>Aktiviraj gumb \"Prijava s Googleom\"</strong> u "
"nastavku i kliknite <strong>Spremi</strong>."

msgid ""
"Change the <strong>Automatically add users from an external authentication "
"source</strong> field to <strong>Yes</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Promijenite polje <strong>Automatski dodaj korisnike iz vanjskog izvora "
"provjere autentičnosti</strong> u <strong>Da</strong>."

msgid "Step 1: Google Cloud Preparation"
msgstr "Korak 1: Google Cloud priprema"

msgid "Critical Warning:"
msgstr "Kritično upozorenje:"

msgid "How to enable Google SSO integration?"
msgstr "Kako omogućiti Google SSO integraciju?"

msgid ""
"Google will generate a <strong>Client ID</strong> and a <strong>Client "
"Secret</strong>. Fill in the fields in this form with those keys."
msgstr ""
"Google će generirati <strong>ID klijenta</strong> i <strong>Klijentsku "
"tajnu</strong>. Ispunite polja u ovom obrascu s tim ključevima."

msgid ""
"Access the <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud Console</a> and create a new "
"<strong>Project</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Pristupite <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud Console</a> i izradite novi "
"<strong>Projekt</strong>."

msgid "Redirect URI:"
msgstr "URI preusmjeravanja:"

msgid "Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button"
msgstr "Aktivirajte gumb \"Prijava s Googleom\"."

msgid ""
"Then go to <strong>Credentials &gt; Create Credentials &gt; OAuth client "
"ID</strong>, choosing the <strong>Web application</strong> type."
msgstr ""
"Zatim idite na <strong>Vjerodajnice &gt; Stvori vjerodajnice &gt; OAuth ID "
"klijenta</strong>, odabir vrste <strong>Web aplikacije</strong>."

msgid "Step 2: GLPI Authentication Preparation"
msgstr "Korak 2: Priprema GLPI provjere autentičnosti"

msgid ""
"Go to <strong>APIs &amp; Services &gt; OAuth consent screen</strong> and "
"configure your app (add the scopes <code>email</code>, <code>profile</code>,"
" and <code>openid</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Idite na <strong>API-je &amp; Usluge &gt; Zaslon pristanka OAuth</strong> i "
"konfigurirajte svoju aplikaciju (dodajte opsege <code>e-pošta</code>, "
"<code>profil</code> i <code>openid</code>)."

msgid "In GLPI, go to <strong>Setup &gt; Authentication &gt; Setup</strong>."
msgstr ""
"U GLPI idite na <strong>Postavljanje &gt; Autentifikacija &gt; "
"Postavljanje</strong>."

msgid ""
"Under <strong>Authorized redirect URIs</strong>, copy and paste exactly the "
"return URL below:"
msgstr ""
"Pod <strong>Ovlašteni URI-ji za preusmjeravanje</strong>, kopirajte i "
"zalijepite točno povratni URL u nastavku:"

msgid ""
"Subdomains are also accepted. E.g.: \"company.com\" will allow "
"user@company.com and user@sub.company.com."
msgstr ""
"Prihvaćaju se i poddomene. Npr.: \"company.com\" će dopustiti "
"user@company.com i user@sub.company.com."

msgid ""
"To test the account creation rules and discover which Profile/Entity will be"
" assigned to an email,"
msgstr ""
"Da biste testirali pravila stvaranja računa i otkrili koji će profil/entitet"
" biti dodijeljen e-pošti,"

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>Session::init()</code>. The GLPI core loads the "
"user\\'s profiles and starts the session. The user is redirected to the "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Dodatak poziva <code>Session::init()</code>. GLPI jezgra učitava korisničke "
"profile i pokreće sesiju. Korisnik se preusmjerava na nadzornu ploču."

msgid "Error Creating Account"
msgstr "Greška pri stvaranju računa"

msgid "No Profile Configured"
msgstr "Profil nije konfiguriran"

msgid "Database Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje baze podataka"

msgid "Do you wish to proceed and create your account now?"
msgstr "Želite li sada nastaviti i stvoriti svoj račun?"

msgid "click here"
msgstr "kliknite ovdje"

msgid "Auto Creation Disabled"
msgstr "Automatsko stvaranje onemogućeno"

msgid "Rules Simulator"
msgstr "Simulator pravila"

msgid ""
"The system would log into the existing account <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)."
" No new account would be created."
msgstr ""
"Sustav bi se prijavio na postojeći račun <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d). Neće "
"se stvoriti novi račun."

msgid "▶️ Simulate Login"
msgstr "▶️ Simulirajte prijavu"

msgid ""
"Extracted domain: <strong>@%s</strong>. Applied rule: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Izdvojena domena: <strong>@%s</strong>. Primijenjeno pravilo: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Configuration Read"
msgstr "Čitanje konfiguracije"

msgid "User \"%s\" already exists. Login would be performed successfully."
msgstr "Korisnik \"%s\" već postoji. Prijava bi bila uspješno izvršena."

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is not allowed. The plugin "
"restricts access to the domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" or its subdomains."
msgstr ""
"Domena e-pošte \"<strong>%s</strong>\" nije dopuštena. Dodatak ograničava "
"pristup domeni \"<strong>%s</strong>\" ili njenim poddomenama."

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>User::add()</code> to create the user "
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\"."
msgstr ""
"Dodatak poziva <code>User::add()</code> za stvaranje korisnika "
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\"."

msgid "using the primary email:"
msgstr "koristeći primarnu e-poštu:"

msgid "User::add() called"
msgstr "Korisnik::add() je pozvan"

msgid "Profile Determined by Plugin"
msgstr "Profil određen dodatkom"

msgid ""
"Profile: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entity: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr ""
"Profil: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entitet: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is allowed by the restriction rule."
msgstr "Domena e-pošte \"<strong>%s</strong>\" dopuštena je pravilom ograničenja."

msgid "Core Default Profile Assigned"
msgstr "Dodijeljen osnovni zadani profil"

msgid "Verified email present: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Prisutna potvrđena adresa e-pošte: <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "The user \"%s\" DOES NOT exist and auto-creation is disabled."
msgstr "Korisnik \"%s\" NE POSTOJI i automatsko kreiranje je onemogućeno."

msgid "Profile Correction by Plugin"
msgstr "Ispravak profila putem dodatka"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Da"

msgid "To access the system via Google, a new account will be created for"
msgstr "Za pristup sustavu putem Googlea, kreirat će se novi račun za"

msgid "Rule Used"
msgstr "Korišteno pravilo"

msgid "Plugin googlesso step"
msgstr "Dodatak googlesso korak"

msgid "Simulator:"
msgstr "Simulator:"

msgid "Account Creation Required"
msgstr "Potrebno je kreirati račun"

msgid "Domain Rule for \"%s\""
msgstr "Pravilo domene za \"%s\""

msgid ""
"This simulator faithfully reproduces the entire execution chain — from the "
"plugin logic to the internal GLPI Core behavior. Enter an email and see "
"step-by-step what would happen in a real login."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj simulator vjerno reproducira cijeli lanac izvršenja — od logike dodatka"
" do internog ponašanja GLPI Core. Unesite adresu e-pošte i pogledajte korak "
"po korak što bi se dogodilo u stvarnoj prijavi."

msgid "Back to configuration"
msgstr "Povratak na konfiguraciju"

msgid "Account Creation Confirmation"
msgstr "Potvrda o stvaranju računa"

msgid "Domain Rules"
msgstr "Pravila domene"

msgid "Account Creation Simulator"
msgstr "Simulator stvaranja računa"

msgid "No"
msgstr "Ne"

msgid "No user found with the email <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Nije pronađen nijedan korisnik s e-adresom <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Login / Email"
msgstr "Prijava / Email"

msgid ""
"The \"Automatically create users\" configuration is "
"<strong>DISABLED</strong>. The login would be blocked."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguracija \"Automatsko stvaranje korisnika\" je "
"<strong>ONEMOGUĆENA</strong>. Prijava bi bila blokirana."

msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(ništa)"

msgid "Login blocked: Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "Prijava blokirana: Prihvaćaju se samo računi s domene %s."

msgid "The user \"%s\" would be created successfully."
msgstr "Korisnik \"%s\" bi bio uspješno kreiran."

msgid ""
"The plugin removes the incorrect profiles assigned by GLPI and explicitly "
"links the profile <strong>%s</strong> and entity <strong>%s</strong> using "
"the <code>Profile_User</code> class."
msgstr ""
"Dodatak uklanja netočne profile koje je dodijelio GLPI i eksplicitno "
"povezuje profil <strong>%s</strong> i entitet <strong>%s</strong> pomoću "
"klase <code>Profile_User</code>."

msgid "Email Validation"
msgstr "Validacija e-pošte"

msgid "User found by email: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr "Korisnik pronađen putem e-pošte: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid "Domain Restriction Check"
msgstr "Provjera ograničenja domene"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Nijedan"

msgid "Session::init() — Login Performed"
msgstr "Session::init() — Prijava izvršena"

msgid "Execution Chain (Step-by-Step)"
msgstr "Lanac izvršenja (korak po korak)"

msgid "Login to Existing Account"
msgstr "Prijavite se na postojeći račun"

msgid "How it works:"
msgstr "Kako radi:"

msgid ""
"In GLPI 11, the core ignores the profile passed by external authentications "
"and automatically assigns the global default profile (usually Self-Service) "
"to the new user."
msgstr ""
"U GLPI 11, jezgra zanemaruje profil koji prosljeđuju vanjske provjere "
"autentičnosti i automatski dodjeljuje globalni zadani profil (obično "
"samoposlužni) novom korisniku."

msgid "Final Entity"
msgstr "Konačni entitet"

msgid "Final Result"
msgstr "Konačni rezultat"

msgid "Back to Login"
msgstr "Natrag na prijavu"

msgid "Simulated Email:"
msgstr "Simulirana e-pošta:"

msgid ""
"Restrict domain: <strong>%s</strong> | Auto create users: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Ograniči domenu: <strong>%s</strong> | Automatsko stvaranje korisnika: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Final Profile"
msgstr "Konačni profil"

msgid ""
"The user \"%s\" would be created, but without ANY profile. Access to GLPI "
"would be denied. Please configure a valid profile in the Default Rule or "
"Domain Rules."
msgstr ""
"Korisnik \"%s\" će biti kreiran, ali bez IKAKVOG profila. Pristup GLPI-ju bi"
" bio odbijen. Molimo konfigurirajte važeći profil u Zadanom pravilu ili "
"Pravilima domene."

msgid "GLPI Core step"
msgstr "Temeljni korak GLPI"

msgid ""
"No valid profile (ID > 0) was found in the plugin rules. The user would be "
"created WITHOUT a profile."
msgstr ""
"U pravilima dodatka nije pronađen važeći profil (ID > 0). Korisnik bi bio "
"kreiran BEZ profila."
